   "core/store/customer_index.py - customer-level recipe memory.\n\nMirrors the layout-level ``recipe_cache`` but keyed by **CUSTOMER NAME**. This is\nthe missing axis of the closed loop:\n\n* Layout cache (``recipe_cache``) makes a *known layout* parse with zero AI.\n* Customer index makes a *known customer with a NEW layout* still recognizable:\n  when AI infers a fresh recipe for a customer we have seen before, we seed the\n  read with that customer's known style/column conventions so the model produces\n  a correct recipe faster and more reliably, then the new recipe is cached as\n  usual. Persisted as ``customer_recipes.json`` beside ``recipe_cache``.\n",
